[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 2760.19, "timestamp": "00:46:00", "text": "可以，当然可以。让我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2763.109, "timestamp": "00:46:03", "text": "了解诅咒的局限性"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2764.79, "timestamp": "00:46:04", "text": "我可以这样做，因为我需要知道"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2766.55, "timestamp": "00:46:06", "text": "那。好的。因为我无法控制我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2768.47, "timestamp": "00:46:08", "text": "嘴。所以，我需要知道这一点，这样我才能……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2772.15, "timestamp": "00:46:12", "text": "但我会意识到这一点。啊，不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2774.63, "timestamp": "00:46:14", "text": "担忧。我给予客人自由，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2776.95, "timestamp": "00:46:16", "text": "合作伙伴。她可以做自己。不"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2778.309, "timestamp": "00:46:18", "text": "担忧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2779.91, "timestamp": "00:46:19", "text": "啊，非常感谢。那就是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2782.55, "timestamp": "00:46:22", "text": "听到这个消息真的很好，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2784.069, "timestamp": "00:46:24", "text": "有时候我甚至不知道如果那样的话"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2785.67, "timestamp": "00:46:25", "text": "这个词实际上是脏话，因为我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2787.19, "timestamp": "00:46:27", "text": "我觉得这是一个很普通的词。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2789.03, "timestamp": "00:46:29", "text": "人们说：“哦，精神病患者真是个混蛋。”我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2789.79, "timestamp": "00:46:29", "text": "说"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2792.043, "timestamp": "00:46:32", "author": "@relaxbreatheblossomasmr5099", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ckcBBCnJoTgzSBf41z6qIrlbXLgznOucPKQ1RdeSjWdIubetNhA8L40rK7FrC8Ymp_UJfKAA5w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAgUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/KsIfY6LzFoLM6AKanYDQAg"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2797.109, "timestamp": "00:46:37", "text": "总之，有一半的事情我甚至都不知道。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2799.109, "timestamp": "00:46:39", "text": "知道它是什么，它意味着什么。所以，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2800.95, "timestamp": "00:46:40", "text": "美好的。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 2803.306, "timestamp": "00:46:43", "author": "@relaxbreatheblossomasmr5099", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ckcBBCnJoTgzSBf41z6qIrlbXLgznOucPKQ1RdeSjWdIubetNhA8L40rK7FrC8Ymp_UJfKAA5w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "stream private incoming"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2811.67, "timestamp": "00:46:51", "text": "哦，等等。什么？你不喜欢哪一个？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2813.51, "timestamp": "00:46:53", "text": "知道？你想让我教你吗？做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2817.109, "timestamp": "00:46:57", "text": "你想让我教你吗？我 我 我 我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 2819.99, "timestamp": "00:46:59", "text": "会非常非常高兴，而且会非常"}]